{
	title: 'One space between card text and its reference',
	spec: 'On the web, every card reference (body, header and thinking card) is as wide as its text and sits one space (1ch) from the text beside it, whatever its length; a body sets --ref-width from its id to reserve exactly that room. An invisible ::after layer keeps each reference a 44px tap target. The terminal already reserves the reference length plus one column.',
